{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And they stood before Joseph.</b> They did not say a word to him, but appeared from afar, and Joseph did not speak to them out of the compassion he had for Benjamin. They supposed that he acted thus out of anger over the money that was found, and therefore they were afraid, as it is written: להתגולל עלינו ולהתנפל עלינו."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:29.064442949Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}